"n1":{"x":2720,"y":5280,"w":420,"size":"m","fill":"blue","text":"How to read this canvas\n\n• Every board has a Dark switch in Tweaks.\n• Colours are the real tokens from src/lib/design-language.ts: first year sky, second violet, third emerald, Master 1 amber; lecture blue, notes teal, exercise orange, exam rose.\n• Success green only for done / finished; primary blue for in progress; yellow only the 4px bar under titles.\n• Behaviour, URLs and copy that tests rely on are unchanged. Data is placeholder (DEMO codes)."},
"n2":{"x":3220,"y":5280,"w":420,"size":"m","fill":"orange","text":"Common changes on every page\n\n• Page title gets the year colour: a year circle or code chip beside it.\n• Cards become flat rounded-3xl surfaces; hover = year-coloured border + small lift (motion-safe).\n• Every resource row: type-coloured icon box + type-name chip + language badge.\n• Active tabs use the year's solid colour.\n• Section headings use a small count beside them instead of a sentence."}
},
